    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00120",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "女人背过脸去，脸上浮起痉挛的表情。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The woman turned her face away, a twitching expression rising over it.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00120",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "她失望了吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She must have been disappointed.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00120",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "真是乡下女人，毫不掩饰。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What a country woman, hiding nothing at all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00120",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他觉得有些不好意思，频频地舔着嘴唇。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He felt somewhat embarrassed and kept licking his lips.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00120",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "“没有澡盆，弄点水冲一冲也可以呀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even without a bathtub, you could at least get some water and rinse yourself off.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00120",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "我呀，浑身上下全是沙子……”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As for me, I am covered with sand from head to toe...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
